# 🎨 CosmicPath Threads Profile Optimization Guide

## 1. Profile Picture (PFP)
**Concept:** "Mysterious Intelligence"
- **Option A (Personal Brand):** A clean, high-contrast black & white photo of a face (or AI avatar) partially in shadow.
- **Option B (Brand Logo):** The CosmicPath logo in Neon Purple on Black Background.
- **Recommendation:** Use a "Human-like AI Avatar" if faceless. It builds more trust than a logo.

## 2. Bio Strategy (The "Hook")
Your bio must answer: "What do I get?" within 2 seconds.

**Option A (Direct Benefit):**
> 🧬 사주 x 점성술 x 수비학 분석 AI
> 📉 2026년 당신의 전성기를 데이터로 증명합니다.
> 👇 내 인생 사용설명서 (무료 테스터 모집 중)
> [Linktree/Website Link]

**Option B (Provocative):**
> 🤖 "인간은 거짓말을 하지만, 데이터는 안 합니다."
> 700만 개의 운명 데이터를 학습한 AI 역술가.
> 당신이 왜 힘들었는지, 언제 풀리는지 알려드림.
> 👇 0원으로 내 운명 확인하기
> [Linktree/Website Link]

## 3. Link Strategy
Don't just use the raw homepage link. Use a deep link or a tracking link.

- **Primary Link:** `https://cosmicpath.app/?ref=threads_bio` (Add UTM tag)
- **Call to Action:** "👆 내 운명 그래프 확인하기"

## 4. Visual Vibe (Feed Esthetic)
- **Background:** Always Black / Dark Charcoal.
- **Text:** White, Sans-serif (Gothic), Bold.
- **Highlight Color:** **Neon Purple (#8B5CF6)** or **Golden Yellow (#FBBF24)** for key numbers/emphasis.
- **Signature:** End every post with a consistent emoji or sign-off (e.g., "🌌 CosmicPath AI")

## 5. Interaction Rules
- **Reply within 10 mins:** The algorithm boosts posts with quick conversations.
- **"DM sent":** When people comment, ALWAYS reply to their comment saying "DM 보내드렸습니다! 📩" (Social proof + Bump).
- **Q&A:** Use the "Poll" feature once a week to ask "What are you worried about? Money vs Love".

---
*Apply these settings immediately to capture the traffic from the 30-Day Plan.*
